{
  "name": "官網留言轉 Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "s-l1",
      "name": "使用者需求摘要",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "### 使用者需求摘要\n官網表單打 webhook，留言貼到 Slack 客服頻道，快速回 200。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "contact-to-slack-g04",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "notes": "建議 webhook:no-auth：建議加標頭認證，避免被亂打（尚未能自動檢查）。目前 credentialMap 沒有可用的標頭憑證。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "name": "Build message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        300,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "text",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ \"新留言：\" + $json.body.message }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "name": "Post to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        600,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "accessToken",
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "#客服"
        },
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "name": "corp-slack-bot"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "Slack 失敗時不阻斷回應。"
    },
    {
      "id": "s-l3",
      "name": "AI 實作說明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 520,
        "content": "### 🤖 AI 實作說明 — 官網留言轉 Slack\n\n**參考來源**\n- 沒有參考外部範本，依需求與 Pack 內建規格設計\n- 骨架與統計知識：research/patterns.md §2 webhook-fire\n- 原廠／社群 Skill：無\n- 目標 n8n 版本：2.44.6（使用者提供）\n- 參考方式：只參考做法，已用目前版本節點重新建構\n\n**建議事項**\n- `webhook:no-auth`：使用者選擇不採用（沒有提供認證憑證，建議日後補上）\n- `error:no-handling`：已採用（Slack 節點失敗時繼續）\n- 不適用：form:no-auth、exec:ssh\n- `native-first:code-node`：已採用（未使用 Code 節點）\n- 以上皆為建議，最終決定在使用者；建議不等於安全\n\n**資安掃描結果**\n- 未執行資安掃描：由宿主檢查\n\n**所需 Credentials**\n- [ ] Slack API：`corp-slack-bot`（節點：Post to Slack）\n\n**已知限制**\n- 參數名稱未經查證\n- 頻道名稱為示意"
      }
    }
  ],
